# Alpha cutout and two-sided faces (ABI 1.20), in the morning sun with four
# cascades, fog and sky. Three cards, each a single quad textured with a grid
# of round green blobs on fully transparent texels:
#  - left: alpha_cutoff 0.5 and STRATA_MATERIAL_DOUBLE_SIDED, turned so the
#    camera sees its back face, which is lit with its normal flipped. Only the
#    blobs draw, and only the blobs' shadows fall on the ground.
#  - middle: two cutout cards crossed at right angles, the usual foliage
#    billboard; blobs of each show through the holes of the other.
#  - right: the same texture with no cutoff, for comparison: an opaque
#    rectangle (its transparent texels keep the blob colour) whose
#    shadow is a solid rectangle. Being one-sided, it is culled from behind.
size 480 270
camera 0 5 14  0 1.6 0  50 0.3 200
lighting sun 0.32 35  4 2048 40 0.6 1
clear 0 0 0 1 sky
item cube 0 -0.5 0  40 1 40  0.62 0.6 0.55
texture blobs discs 128 128 3 3 0.3 0.65 0.22 mipmaps

# Left: a two-sided cutout card, turned 200 degrees so its back faces the camera.
mesh 1 1 1
vertices -1.5 0 0  1.5 0 0  1.5 3 0  -1.5 3 0
uvs 0 1  1 1  1 0  0 0
triangles 0 1 2  0 2 3
mesh_texture blobs
mesh_cutoff 0.5
mesh_double_sided
mesh_transform -4.2 0 0  0 1 0  0 200 1

# Middle: two crossed cutout cards.
mesh 1 1 1
vertices -1.5 0 0  1.5 0 0  1.5 3 0  -1.5 3 0
uvs 0 1  1 1  1 0  0 0
triangles 0 1 2  0 2 3
mesh_texture blobs
mesh_cutoff 0.5
mesh_double_sided
mesh_transform 0 0 0  0 1 0  0 45 1
mesh 1 1 1
vertices -1.5 0 0  1.5 0 0  1.5 3 0  -1.5 3 0
uvs 0 1  1 1  1 0  0 0
triangles 0 1 2  0 2 3
mesh_texture blobs
mesh_cutoff 0.5
mesh_double_sided
mesh_transform 0 0 0  0 1 0  0 -45 1

# Right: the same texture without a cutoff.
mesh 1 1 1
vertices -1.5 0 0  1.5 0 0  1.5 3 0  -1.5 3 0
uvs 0 1  1 1  1 0  0 0
triangles 0 1 2  0 2 3
mesh_texture blobs
mesh_transform 4.2 0 0  0 1 0  0 -20 1

# A ray through the middle of a hole of the left card (between blobs) still
# hits the card: picking sees geometry, not texels.
expect_ray -4.2 1.5 6  0 0 -1  20 0
